{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-14",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "调任助理策划  (Transferred to Assistant Planner)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With the chief content officer reform passed, Chun Yuqiao discusses his strategy with Xingtian's chairwoman by phone, Kaiwen tries to smooth things over with Unit Two's bitter head, and Bu Xiaogu receives a surprise transfer call. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "明白，董事长，我们一部一定做到！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "外面的谈判还在推进，还需要再谈几轮吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "因为李铭基的事情，电视台提出要派人常驻星天，双方关系会很紧张。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不过电视台派人是为了监督节目质量，我想这未必是件坏事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "孙总和一些元老一直比较抵触改革，内部强推难免伤感情。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在有了外部力量推动，我们不妨试试。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "好的，对事不对人，再见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "孙总，今天会上这个事确实挺突然的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这样吧孙总，我代表淳于总向您表个态。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "好，您的话我一定转告老大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，雷总您好，请问有什么事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "接到调令，明天开始我不做行政助理，调去总编室做助理策划？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "太好了！好的雷总，雷总再见！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "明白，董事长，我们一部一定做到！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Understood, Chairwoman — Unit One will definitely get it done!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "外面的谈判还在推进，还需要再谈几轮吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The outside negotiations are still moving forward and will take a few more rounds.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "因为李铭基的事情，电视台提出要派人常驻星天，双方关系会很紧张。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Over Li Mingji's incident, the network insisted on stationing staff at Xingtian, making ties tense.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不过电视台派人是为了监督节目质量，我想这未必是件坏事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet the network sent staff to supervise show quality, which I think may not be a bad thing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "孙总和一些元老一直比较抵触改革，内部强推难免伤感情。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Sun and some veterans have resisted reform, and forcing it internally would hurt feelings.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在有了外部力量推动，我们不妨试试。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now that we have outside pressure pushing things forward, we might as well try.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "好的，对事不对人，再见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright — focus on the work rather than personal grudges; goodbye.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "孙总，今天会上这个事确实挺突然的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Sun, what happened at today's meeting was indeed quite sudden.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这样吧孙总，我代表淳于总向您表个态。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tell you what, Mr Sun — let me say a word on Mr Chun Yuqiao's behalf.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "好，您的话我一定转告老大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, I will be sure to pass your message on to our boss.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，雷总您好，请问有什么事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello Director Lei, may I ask what is up?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "接到调令，明天开始我不做行政助理，调去总编室做助理策划？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A transfer order came in — starting tomorrow I leave admin to become assistant planner in the chief editor's office?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "太好了！好的雷总，雷总再见！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wonderful! Understood, Director Lei — goodbye!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "明白，董事长，我们一部一定做到！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "外面的谈判还在推进，还需要再谈几轮吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
